<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pentair cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pentair cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth analyst J. Blair Brumley said Monday he downgraded Pentair Inc to a hold from buy based on the stock's recent performance.</p>
<p>-- It closed June 6 at 34-3/8, just short of Dain's price target of $35 a share. Shares Monday were unchanged at 34-3/8.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Recent conversation with the company indicates that while there is certainly nothing amiss, there also does not appear to be a near-term catalyst to argue for a significant increase in (Pentair's) valuation,&quot; Brumley said in a report.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
